      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. I'll improve understandability by removing the ~30 unused imports, removing the two unused data methods (`data_plus`/`data_minus`), and adding grouping comments to the assertions.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed ~30 unused imports and the two unused `data_plus`/`data_minus` methods, then added three inline comments to group the assertions by H1 months, H2 months, and the identity-conversion case — making the intent of each assertion block immediately clear."
